  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a community-based and demand-driven project aimed at increasing productivity in groundnut production, improving groundnut oil and cake processing capacity, creating productive rural employment and improving incomes and living standards of cooperative members among others.</narrative>
